 ot a Senate general-election runoff rule\nNo general early voting. For q
 ualifying absentee voters\, in-person absentee voting ends at noon Novem
 ber 28.\nMail: postmark by December 1\; delivery within five business da
 ys\, by December 8. Eligibility and permitted return method still apply.
